{"logId": "9eca6fca-2770-41f6-9b43-95aadf3055ca", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 456, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "h.装修新房子时，采用插卡取电的排线方式，除冰箱等不断电外，全部电源一卡断电（此项为加分项+0.1分）\n（3）居家用气安全\na. 天然气、液化气软管、阀门未存在老化破损，电磁炉工作环境无安全隐患\n\nb. 灶台上不要放置可燃类物品和易燃易爆物品：禁止开火做饭时喷杀虫剂；禁止在点燃的燃气灶旁倒面粉\n\nc. 厨房使用燃气时不能擅自离人，避免造成干烧现象\n\nd. 厨房抽油烟机外部随手清洁，内部半年一次全面保养清洁，避免油污过大形成火灾隐患\n\ne. 定期（6个月）对厨房天然气阀门及管道接口检查有无漏气现象，若发现漏气及时寻找专业人员进行维修（用带泡沫水的刷子涂抹软管及气嘴部分，观察是否有气泡；或加装燃气泄漏报警装置）\n\nf. 使用完毕后必须切断开关\n\ng. 不要将燃气表或阀门封闭在独立空间内，如装修时在柜体内，要经常打开柜门并开窗通风\n（4）电梯安全\na. 严禁超载使用电梯；严禁用身体或物体阻止电梯门的关闭；严禁在电梯内玩耍、打闹、跳跃、乱摁按钮", "block_bbox": [199, 216, 1013, 666], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 216.0], [1013.0, 216.0], [1013.0, 666.0], [199.0, 666.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[40]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 738], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 492, 932], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [492.0, 900.0], [492.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "b. 掌握电梯突发事故的自救方法：电梯被困时，使用电梯内警报按钮或拨打电话等待救援；电梯急速下坠时，从下至上快速按下每一层的按键，可以有机会使电梯在中间的某一层可能会停下来；手掌紧贴电梯内墙壁，双腿膝盖轻微弯曲，踮起脚后跟，缓解着地时的压力，保护我们的双腿和脚后跟", "block_bbox": [219, 973, 1052, 1058], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 973.0], [1052.0, 973.0], [1052.0, 1058.0], [219.0, 1058.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、居住条件便捷舒适、满足日常功能及生活需求", "block_bbox": [220, 1064, 615, 1089], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1064.0], [615.0, 1064.0], [615.0, 1089.0], [220.0, 1089.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）居家功能配备齐全，洗衣机、淋浴、天然气、冰箱等满足日常生活需求，并逐步增加功能性电器满足生活的便捷和品质", "block_bbox": [220, 1095, 1051, 1149], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1095.0], [1051.0, 1095.0], [1051.0, 1149.0], [220.0, 1149.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [203, 1194, 337, 1218], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 1194.0], [337.0, 1194.0], [337.0, 1218.0], [203.0, 1218.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、为了省钱选择老旧、存在安全隐患的住房", "block_bbox": [218, 1235, 577, 1258], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1235.0], [577.0, 1235.0], [577.0, 1258.0], [218.0, 1258.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、好高骛远，因不合理的住房造成经济和生活压力", "block_bbox": [218, 1265, 630, 1289], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1265.0], [630.0, 1265.0], [630.0, 1289.0], [218.0, 1289.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、违反居家安全标准", "block_bbox": [219, 1296, 399, 1319], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1296.0], [399.0, 1296.0], [399.0, 1319.0], [219.0, 1319.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）住房存在电线老化、用气隐患等问题，且长期不整改", "block_bbox": [229, 1325, 684, 1350], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[235.0, 1325.0], [683.0, 1325.0], [683.0, 1349.0], [235.0, 1349.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）私自安装、拆除各种电器设备", "block_bbox": [230, 1356, 506, 1380], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[230.0, 1356.0], [506.0, 1356.0], [506.0, 1380.0], [230.0, 1380.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）私自操作、维修燃气漏气问题", "block_bbox": [231, 1387, 506, 1411], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1387.0], [506.0, 1387.0], [506.0, 1411.0], [231.0, 1411.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[41]", "block_bbox": [611, 1476, 650, 1498], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1476.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7629238367080688, "coordinate": [165, 140, 456, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [456.0, 140.0], [456.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5556115508079529, "coordinate": [205, 215, 1015, 269], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[205.0, 215.0], [1015.0, 215.0], [1015.0, 269.0], [205.0, 269.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5315089225769043, "coordinate": [199, 216, 1013, 666], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 216.0], [1013.0, 216.0], [1013.0, 666.0], [199.0, 666.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.32860326766967773, "coordinate": [201, 308, 803, 331], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[207.0, 308.0], [207.0, 330.0], [802.0, 330.0], [802.0, 308.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3732748329639435, "coordinate": [206, 339, 1008, 393], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[206.0, 339.0], [1008.0, 339.0], [1008.0, 393.0], [206.0, 393.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.33287107944488525, "coordinate": [212, 430, 917, 454], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[212.0, 430.0], [917.0, 430.0], [917.0, 454.0], [212.0, 454.0]